            {
                "entry_id": "90ad5b98-a2cc-3261-84d0-6bcf97d681cf",
                "word": "paralytic",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "93562e36-e822-48d3-bf4b-cc525d7fb7b4",
                        "entry_id": "90ad5b98-a2cc-3261-84d0-6bcf97d681cf",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "paralytics"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6b5e5258-f4cc-3a18-9ca1-c2910a497987",
                        "entry_id": "90ad5b98-a2cc-3261-84d0-6bcf97d681cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone suffering from paralysis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8eaef263-199f-4131-a3bd-188c0c5c06a5",
                                "sense_id": "6b5e5258-f4cc-3a18-9ca1-c2910a497987",
                                "text": "Quoth I to myself, \"Haply this Shaykh is of those who were wrecked in the ship and hath made his way to this island.\" So I drew near to him and saluted him, and he returned my salam by signs, but spoke not; and I said to him, \"O nuncle mine, what causeth thee to sit here?\" He shook his head and moaned and signed to me with his hand as who should say, \"Take me on thy shoulders and carry me to the other side of the well-channel.\" And quoth I in my mind, \"I will deal kindly with him and do what he desireth; it may be I shall win me a reward in Heaven for he may be a paralytic.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8185ad56-194a-3750-9409-4b85fa25a129",
                        "entry_id": "90ad5b98-a2cc-3261-84d0-6bcf97d681cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A drug that produces paralysis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "72c72811-aca0-4c81-b769-6fbd1ffd16aa",
                                "sense_id": "8185ad56-194a-3750-9409-4b85fa25a129",
                                "text": "For example, use of paralytics in morbidly obese patients or those with spinal instability can precipitate complete upper airway obstruction."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5a6ec73f-2f1b-4b84-bb72-28ce1be0fc44",
                        "source_entry_id": "90ad5b98-a2cc-3261-84d0-6bcf97d681cf",
                        "source_sense_description": "person suffering from paralysis",
                        "target_lang_word": "paralytique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paralytique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a98e1ac-c5ab-336f-82e4-88f04cb6bf12",
                                        "entry_id": "dcea6dca-bdd3-3058-9469-1255c2505972",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Atteint de paralysie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55817738-d086-4088-a626-054481b6d916",
                                                "sense_id": "2a98e1ac-c5ab-336f-82e4-88f04cb6bf12",
                                                "text": "Il est paralytique de la moitié du corps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e34afc4a-e979-4ea5-9c95-f73566486946",
                                                "sense_id": "2a98e1ac-c5ab-336f-82e4-88f04cb6bf12",
                                                "text": "Elle est paralytique d’un bras."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "679167df-c1ba-4be4-bced-77f03c3f60a3",
                                                "sense_id": "2a98e1ac-c5ab-336f-82e4-88f04cb6bf12",
                                                "text": "Il est resté paralytique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee3280bf-9214-4397-8ebc-98de30906a00",
                                                "sense_id": "2a98e1ac-c5ab-336f-82e4-88f04cb6bf12",
                                                "text": "De plus intelligents et de plus expérimentés que moi auraient pu eux aussi commettre cette bévue, inviter à danser une jeune fille paralytique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64c714e9-eec5-4768-a680-a7a281df6223",
                                                "sense_id": "2a98e1ac-c5ab-336f-82e4-88f04cb6bf12",
                                                "text": "Là-bas, les paralytiques retrouvaient leurs jambes dès que Papa Moupelo leur criait « Levez-vous et marchez ! »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "paralytique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d363a81-ffdc-33a8-9a94-95cbd3e3c11f",
                                        "entry_id": "68f3130c-cf98-3c00-b750-f624add91413",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne atteinte de paralysie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34a05ac9-d028-4560-9724-e2237b62aaff",
                                                "sense_id": "5d363a81-ffdc-33a8-9a94-95cbd3e3c11f",
                                                "text": "De tous les pays circonvoisins, des campagnes et des villes, malades et infirmes, paralytiques, culs-de-jatte et pieds-bots accouraient dans des carrioles, dans des calèches, sur des ânes, sur leurs moignons calleux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8809f27d-39af-4476-ab08-18b17db38ac7",
                                                "sense_id": "5d363a81-ffdc-33a8-9a94-95cbd3e3c11f",
                                                "text": "Le lieutenant Souchier a reçu de sa femme la nouvelle qu'il y a quarante prisonniers à Roanne! Pas un enfant, pas une vieille paralytique, sur la route de Charlieu, qui ne les ait déjà vus."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
